Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:50:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cursor): the IDE writer names no workspace the document
 never named (pr/83)

CursorProjector fell back to workspace `/` when neither the caller nor
the view named a directory, so gemini -> cursor read back with
`paths[].path.base.uri` and `environment.working_dir` it never had.
With no directory the head now carries no workspaceIdentifier (a
caller-given id keeps the id with no uri). Sources with a cwd and
callers that pass a project directory write as before.

round_trip@gemini@cursor: both gained keys gone, after key_paths 54 -> 52.
